This distribution is a modified version of the upstream project, redistributed
under the Apache License 2.0 as com.applooma:rtc-core-android.

Copyright 2026 AppLooma LLC

Changes made relative to upstream version 2.12.0:

  - Changed the Maven coordinates, POM metadata and project name.
  - Removed the sample applications, test harnesses, custom lint checks and
    release tooling, which are not part of the published library.
  - Vendored the protocol definitions that upstream carries as a git submodule,
    pinned to the same commit (9e8d1e37c5eb4434424bc16c657c83e7dc63bc2a), so the
    build is reproducible from this repository alone.

No functional changes were made to the media transport implementation. The Java
package names inside the library are unchanged, because renaming them would mean
rewriting every source file for no visible benefit to an integrator. The original
copyright notices are retained in every source file, and the Apache License 2.0
text is included in LICENSE.
